  Ask for help connecting to BrainFuse for tutoring support and writing he
 lp.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming
  place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are 
 always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a 
 branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Kennedy/Eglinton
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e134bc2866a5b488490297
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
