BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kimbap Making with Chef Sang
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260704T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260704T140000
UID:69fcd5875a8c322f03c7637c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:TV host and celebrity chef Sang Kim will teach the basics of m
 aking Korean-style kimbap\, exactly like you see them on your favourite K-
 dramas. Participants will roll and cut kimbap using ingredients prepared b
 y the Chef and eat their own creations. A brief history of kimbap\, its di
 fferences from the Japanese sushi roll\, and eating etiquette will also be
  shared. Prizes are also awarded for best kimbap creations.\nNB: Ingredien
 ts include egg and fishcake (which participants do not have to use)\nFor t
 eens ages 13-17. Registration required.
LOCATION:Victoria Village\, Program room\, downstairs.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fcd5875a8c322f03c7637c
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
