 creen. Whether you're a first-time viewer or long-time fan\, these movies 
 are sure to please.\nMay 7: Apollo 13 (1995\, PG)\nMay 14: The Martian (2
 015\, PG)\n* special start time! 5:30 pm\nMay 21: Contact (1997\, PG)\n* s
 pecial start time! 5:30 pm\nMay 28: Star Trek (2009\, PG)\nAll are welcome
 . Drop-in\, no registration required.
