BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Special Program: Intimate Musical Experience featuring Marielle Di
 vino
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260525T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260525T190000
UID:69f8f4de5a8c322f03c70c33@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Marielle Divino’s performance is an intimate musical set tha
 t includes original songs\, unreleased songs and thoughtfully chosen cover
 s.  The performance will be acoustic\, incorporating voice guitar and harp
  to create a calm\, welcoming atmosphere.  She will share brief reflectio
 ns on songwriting\, inspiration\, and arrangement\, giving audiences insig
 ht into her creative process and the role of different instruments in shap
 ing a song.
LOCATION:St. Lawrence\, Children's Department\, North Side of building.  E
 nter through Courtyard.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f8f4de5a8c322f03c70c33
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
