BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Being Jewish: What it Means to Me
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260520T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260520T180000
UID:69e126ea8ddc1caf5f1d5d79@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Erin Silver's book I Am Jewish\, is about what being Jewish me
 ans to me (the author). This presentation will explore the religion in way
 s that other kids can relate.\nParticipants can expect to learn what it me
 ans to be Jewish\, including values\, holidays\, celebrations and contribu
 tions to the world. There will also be a special craft activity.\nRegistra
 tion required.
LOCATION:Wychwood\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e126ea8ddc1caf5f1d5d79
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
